---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Editorial Policy"
			description="How Massage Business Growth selects topics, uses AI assistance, and maintains content quality."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section>
				<h1>Editorial Policy</h1>
				<h2>How we choose topics</h2>
				<p>
					Topics are selected based on recurring local marketing decisions massage businesses face: Google Maps
					visibility, review operations, service-page quality, and booking conversion friction.
				</p>

				<h2>How we avoid generic SEO advice</h2>
				<p>
					We avoid one-size-fits-all SEO content. Articles are written with massage-specific context such as
					service menus, local intent modifiers, review behavior, and front-desk workflows.
				</p>

				<h2>How we handle AI-assisted writing</h2>
				<p>
					AI may assist drafting, outlining, or editing, but content is reviewed and structured for practical
					use. We remove generic phrasing and prioritize concrete implementation guidance.
				</p>

				<h2>Accuracy and integrity rules</h2>
				<p>
					We do not fabricate customer cases, ranking outcomes, or performance data. Educational examples are
					clearly framed as examples and should not be interpreted as verified client results.
				</p>

				<h2>Important disclaimer</h2>
				<p>
					Content on this site is for educational purposes only and does not constitute legal, medical, or
					financial advice.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	section {
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #d2dfeb;
		border-radius: 14px;
		padding: 1.6rem;
	}
	h1,
	h2 {
		color: #0b3a53;
	}
	h2 {
		margin-top: 1.2rem;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}
</style>
